    "semantic_checks": [
      "Invitation values come from the original server task rules; clipboard copy/paste and confirm counts must be exact integer 1.",
      "First account binds automatically to authenticated Worker; account changes stop work and require original rebind.",
      "New customer binding requires a submitted system invitation, complete remark shortcode and one native peer wxid in the same friend object.",
      "History starts at actual system invitation submission; same-second boundary ambiguity, unknown ordering or incomplete coverage blocks AI sends.",
      "Raw persistence alone is not semantic dispatch, history completeness or recipient delivery.",
      "New raw facts invalidate ready history before dispatch; replay of the same event is idempotent.",
      "Native send permit binds Worker, instance, epoch, process generation, customer binding revision, task lease and original Flow.",
      "Each native send attempt is journaled before the physical call; unknown or ambiguous outcomes are held without automatic resend.",
      "A unique historical self message matched by exact text and bounded time provides local send evidence only; it is not recipient delivery.",
      "Original C3 Brain/Guard, reply sequence and sent acknowledgement remain authoritative; no parallel business state machine.",
      "Native private-account identities retain the provider value exactly, including supported legacy usernames without wxid_; syntax never replaces exact account, unique shortcode, direction, lease or binding checks."
    ]
  },
